msgstr "The NKFIH or other grant identifier(s) the publication can be linked to (e.g. \"K 123456\"). MTMT doesn't provide this automatically either. The \"Verified\" checkbox indicates that someone has manually checked the identifier above is correct — it records who did so and when."

